### 2. `samples/camt.053-uae-statement.xml`

You already have the `pacs.008`, `pain.001`, and `broken-payload` XML files embedded in your validator script. Add this **`camt.053`** sample as the fourth file so all three schemas listed on your [ISO 20022 XML Message Validator](https://aurigga.com/tools/iso20022-validator.php) have matching downloadable examples:

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
